          "title": "Lecture Notes: React 18 Concurrent Rendering & State Models",
          "type": "page",
          "published": true,
          "required": true,
          "completionCondition": "view",
          "content": "### CHED CMO 25 Module Learning Outcome 1\nThis module covers modern SPA architecture patterns, client-side state management, LocalStorage persistence layers, and React 18 hooks architecture.\n\nKey Concepts:\n1. Virtual DOM reconciliation algorithm\n2. Pure functional state reducers\n3. LocalStorage reactive sync hooks\n4. RBAC route guarding",
          "completed": true
        }
